@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我和诺亚的事<br>很快就被所有少女知道了。|#0201Adv21_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟是我自己告诉所有人的。|#0201Adv21_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……你在做什么呢？|#0201Adv21_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:打扫卫生。|#0201Adv21_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我一直在擦拭会客厅里那些神秘的装饰品。<br>全神贯注地擦。|#0201Adv21_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（从以前这个习惯就一直改不掉。<br>　一遇到什么事就立刻用打扫来逃避）|#0201Adv21_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我只想重新回到正确。回到规则。回到节律。<br>　回到健全）|#0201Adv21_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使彻底把室内打扫得干干净净，<br>刚才和诺亚的对话还是一直萦绕在心头。|#0201Adv21_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……我被她讨厌了）|#0201Adv21_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（管它呢。<br>　为这种事心情低落……可不像我的作风）|#0201Adv21_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，没关系的！<br>打扫会有看守来做的！|#0201Adv21_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我知道。|#0201Adv21_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嘴上回答着，我加大了擦拭的力度，<br>没有回头看雪莉。|#0201Adv21_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:难得的放风时间，<br>要不要和我一起去探索一下！？|#0201Adv21_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我拒绝。|#0201Adv21_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……？|#0201Adv21_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉依然保持着笑容，<br>但看起来很茫然，好像不理解我的行为。|#0201Adv21_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Sherry Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（有个空瓶子……这是在晾干吗？）|#0201Adv21_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:壁炉前放着一个空瓶，<br>那是之前在医务室看到梅露露拿着的安眠药瓶。|#0201Adv21_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:里面是空的，<br>所以能够推测它是已经洗干净了，正在晾干。|#0201Adv21_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这个瓶子看来<br>　就这样放着比较好）|#0201Adv21_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来，希罗！<br>昨天我又去图书室调查了，<br>试着解读那些文字！|#0201Adv21_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:你有好好听人说话吗？|#0201Adv21_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 大量の本を積み上げる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_118 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不一会，传来了一声沉重的响声。|#0201Adv21_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR11,ArmL10

[PrintTextModified Text:一看，原来是雪莉<br>用怪力从图书室搬来了大量的书，<br>然后把书都堆在了会客厅的桌子上。|#0201Adv21_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎是些古老的书籍，<br>书堆摇摇欲坠，扬起了灰尘。|#0201Adv21_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:咳……！刚打扫完就……|#0201Adv21_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉毫不在意，一边念叨着一边开始<br>对照笔记和书本。|#0201Adv21_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……看来暂时是<br>　没法打扫这个房间了）|#0201Adv21_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我放弃了这里，准备打扫别的房间，<br>于是朝着房间出口走去。|#0201Adv21_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:9_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.99 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:——那之后我想了想。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正要出门，冷不丁被人搭话。|#0201Adv21_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:一看，是奈叶香<br>正靠墙站着。|#0201Adv21_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不会和你联手。<br>不过，看起来你是拥有力量的。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:……力量？|#0201Adv21_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许你能改变些什么。<br>……我就是这么觉得。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:我想确认一下，<br>你的【幻视】能看到未来吗？|#0201Adv21_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香犹豫了一下，<br>摇了摇头。|#0201Adv21_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我的【幻视】主要<br>能看到人或物的过去。<br>不过，在极其限定的情况下，偶尔也能看到未来。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是多次接触过的对象，<br>也有时能看到未来……|#0201Adv21_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香话说到一半，<br>面露悲色地低下了头。|#0201Adv21_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（多次接触？是亲人吗……？）|#0201Adv21_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许我从你身上<br>感觉到了什么。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka006| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:从我身上……？|#0201Adv21_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是魔力之类的吗……？<br>　难道是因为魔女化造成的影响……）|#0201Adv21_Hiro017|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我稍作思考。<br>然后抬起头，凝视着奈叶香。|#0201Adv21_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:关于【魔女化】，你知道些什么吗？|#0201Adv21_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香以前说过，<br>她掌握了很多关于这座监牢的信息。|#0201Adv21_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在我想尽可能多获得一些<br>关于【魔女化】的信息。|#0201Adv21_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我恳切地问道。<br>奈叶香再次面露难色。|#0201Adv21_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我把握得也不是很清楚……<br>但我只知道，在转化为【残骸】的过程中，<br>每个人都会有不同的表现。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka007| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果因为某些契机，被强烈刺激到内心的创伤，<br>就会迅速魔女化。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka008| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但如果仅仅只是积攒过多压力，<br>应该还是能较长时间保持理性。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka009| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说，取决于自己心灵有多坚强吧。|#0201Adv21_Nanoka010| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:是这样吗……|#0201Adv21_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我稍稍放心了些。|#0201Adv21_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:之前我险些失控，<br>但如今已经能克制住自己，保持理性。|#0201Adv21_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我确信自己已经挺过来了。|#0201Adv21_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果取决于自己内心的坚强程度，<br>　那我之后一定不会堕为魔女）|#0201Adv21_Hiro020|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:正在我悄悄下定决心的时候，<br>奈叶香已经不知不觉间离开了。|#0201Adv21_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

