@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:被涂成白色的室内，<br>没有人影。|#0201Adv21_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还未干透的颜料散发出的刺激性气味<br>扑鼻而来。|#0201Adv21_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（安安已经康复了，<br>　我看到她和诺亚一起去了画室）|#0201Adv21_Hiro024|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那两个人看起来虽然那样，实际上可能关系还不错。<br>　也许只是我一个人在大惊小怪……）|#0201Adv21_Hiro025|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到她们一起去画室的时候，<br>由于在意自己和诺亚之间的隔阂，<br>没敢向她们搭话。|#0201Adv21_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（已经回不去了、吗）|#0201Adv21_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在环境恶劣，却整齐有序的牢房中，<br>我走进这个被格格不入的白色完全覆盖的房间……|#0201Adv21_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:凝视着自己的手掌。|#0201Adv21_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:后悔可真不像我的作风。|#0201Adv21_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:话音刚落——<br>突然间，背脊一阵发凉。|#0201Adv21_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:感觉到有人正无声无息地站在我的背后。<br>还没来得及回头。|#0201Adv21_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

