[PrintTextModified Text:很痛吧……|#0201Adv21_Unknown002| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆宝生マーゴの声マネ魔法・ささやき
; ＠氷上メルル

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，很抱歉，<br>必须请你去死才行……|#0201Adv21_Unknown003| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

